: Written by hand from the Ollama OpenAI-compatibility docs
: (https://github.com/ollama/ollama/blob/main/docs/openai.md): the endpoint emits a
: complete tool call in one chunk, omits the `index` field, and reports no `usage`.
: A decoder that requires `index` drops the call; one that leaves usage at zero turns
: max_total_tokens into a limit that never trips.
